gm-method (impostor frustum cull + remote player visibility radius): impostor per-instance cull sphere must be sized to the WHOLE-TREE bounding sphere, not the unit-plane or zero-geo * scale (trees pop out near frustum edge if sized wrong). SkinnedMesh player frustumCulled=false on EVERY VRM attach path including the pool-routed one -- set it in the pool spawn callback too or remote players disappear. Remote-player visibility must track worldConfig.relevanceRadius, not a hardcoded constant -- hardcoded values silently break when the server changes the radius.